<title>SINGAPORE: Guthrie pre-tax profit to improve in '97.</title>
<headline>Guthrie pre-tax profit to improve in '97.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property-based Guthrie GTS Ltd said on Friday it expected its pre-tax profit to improve in the current year.  </p>
<p>Guthrie said in a statement:</p>
<p>&quot;On prospects, the directors are confident that the continued strong performance in both its engineering and property businesses will result in improved operating profit before tax this current year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroon (65 870 3199)</p>
